{"id":"sc_concept_chirality","record_type":"concept","topic_refs":["sc_topic_chirality"],"name_zh":"分子手性","name_en":"molecular chirality","summary_zh":"分子与其镜像不能通过空间旋转完全重合时表现出的几何性质。","teaching_priority":"common","teaching_notes":["手性是整体结构性质，不能简单等同于“含有手性碳”。"],"source_refs":["sc_src_iupac_goldbook","sc_src_cn_curriculum_2020"],"status":"reviewed"}
