{"id":"sc_rel_chirality_recognition","record_type":"structure_property_relation","topic_refs":["sc_topic_chirality","sc_topic_intermolecular_forces"],"name_zh":"手性环境中的选择性识别","teaching_priority":"extended","facts":{"relation":"一对对映体在非手性环境中的许多宏观物理性质可非常接近，但与手性分子或手性环境相互作用时可表现出不同选择性。","condition":"具体差异取决于所处体系和相互作用，不由“手性”单独决定所有性质。"},"source_refs":["sc_src_cn_curriculum_2020","sc_src_iupac_goldbook"],"status":"reviewed"}
